Like I kept this page the whole time.

00:11:15.541 --> 00:11:18.077
Nymeria is meant to be
this really inspirational figure

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.980
to a lot of women in Westeros,
particularly to Rhaenyra,

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.448
because she was a woman of great power

00:11:22.448 --> 00:11:24.550
who's remembered
for doing very great things.

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:27.887
Originally she was a princess
from the Raynor people over here in Essos.

00:11:27.887 --> 00:11:31.057
They were pushed out of their ancestral
homeland by the ancient Bulgarians.

00:11:31.057 --> 00:11:33.092
During the expansion of the freehold.

00:11:33.092 --> 00:11:37.296
They retreated with the 10,000 ships
to Westeros landing in Dorne

00:11:37.296 --> 00:11:38.597
and conquering the area.

00:11:38.597 --> 00:11:41.834
The Martell's descend from her line,
which is part of the reason

00:11:41.834 --> 00:11:45.071
why the Martell's have hated
the Targaryens in the crown for so long.

00:11:45.071 --> 00:11:48.107
They didn't bend the knee
during Aegon's conquest and only joined

00:11:48.107 --> 00:11:51.977
the other six kingdoms as part of Westeros
much, much later in the timeline.

00:11:51.977 --> 00:11:55.147
Well, after the events
of the Dance of the Dragons,

00:11:55.147 --> 00:11:58.918
there was a series about the Golden Empire
set in the distant past, long

00:11:58.918 --> 00:12:00.286
before the rise of the valyrian

00:12:00.286 --> 00:12:03.723
freehold set in this country
over here in eastern essos.

00:12:03.723 --> 00:12:05.024
It sounds like it was one of the series

00:12:05.024 --> 00:12:07.626
that they delayed indefinitely,
like effectively canceled.

00:12:07.626 --> 00:12:10.730
Maybe it will come back in some form
in the distant future.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:14.066
There was a series set in fleabottom
after the events of House of the Dragon,

00:12:14.066 --> 00:12:15.801
but before the main series, Fleabottom

00:12:15.801 --> 00:12:17.703
