Landing that we visited

00:12:17.703 --> 00:12:20.239
several times on the main series
and on House of the Dragon.

00:12:20.239 --> 00:12:24.210
Damon spends a lot of his time there
horsing around, as does Egg on the second.

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.778
I believe they canceled this.

00:12:25.778 --> 00:12:28.814
I don't think they're planning
on making a flea bottom series anymore.

00:12:28.814 --> 00:12:30.783
There was also the infamous Blood

00:12:30.783 --> 00:12:34.019
Moon prequel series
that they canceled a long time ago.

00:12:34.019 --> 00:12:37.823
It was set before the first long night,
thousands of thousands of years ago.

00:12:37.823 --> 00:12:40.593
This was the famous pilot
